# fu17-deep-flows.keys — FU-17 verified deep-flow navigation (tournament).
#
# One AUTOTYPE step (comma = 0.2 s; see docs/ghidra/FU13_headless_input.md).
# Timeline and the screens each key reaches (frame-verified in
# captures/session-probe-flow-1):
#   10 s  enter       skip the looping intro
#   18 s  down        GAME SELECT: Friendly -> Leagues
#   21 s  down        Leagues -> Tournaments
#   25 s  enter       open TOURNAMENT (purple flag grid; slow purple fade-in)
#   34 s  enter       International -> TOURNAMENT TEAM SELECT
#   44 s  enter       check the highlighted country (Algeria in the run-1 draw)
#   50 s  down, 60/64 s enter, 70 s down
#                     walk the team-select dialog (same rhythm as the FU-16
#                     league route; unlocks the bottom Play button)
#   78/82/86 s right  focus the bottom Play button
#   90 s  enter       open the TOURNAMENT SCHEDULE (Game 1..Game 5 buttons,
#                     group fixtures, "Next Game", Simulate, bottom bar
#                     Load / Standings / Play)
#   102 s enter       open TOURNAMENT STANDINGS (Group A-D, P/W/D/L/C/A/Pts)
#   112 s enter       back to the schedule
#
# New screens reached: TOURNAMENT TEAM SELECT, TOURNAMENT SCHEDULE,
# TOURNAMENT STANDINGS. This sequence does NOT enter the mode classifier
# (0x26B45) and does NOT reach probe site 7 (FUN_00014c18); the per-fixture
# Play cells and Simulate button were not keyboard-reachable in our runs.
# See docs/ghidra/FU17_deep_flows.md for the six-run campaign, the mode
# inventory and the honest gaps.
